**Drafting review comments and summary**
codex
I found one correctness issue that can bypass budget enforcement: malformed/unreadable `budget.json` is treated as “no budget” via a broad `catch`, and the tests currently lock that behavior in. I’m writing/posting the review with a MUST-FIX on the fail-open logic and a follow-up test comment.
